_:r2836a791b1d923c06464510c_n7148f7a34fe148e7ba9a9aa9f392c117b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Advanced Image Processing in Magnetic Resonance Imaging: fMRI, MRI, EEG, MEG" .
_:r2836a791b1d923c06464510c_n7148f7a34fe148e7ba9a9aa9f392c117b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
