_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_nf164a53f986845c0ae4c11f94abd4b46b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/locator> .
_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_nf164a53f986845c0ae4c11f94abd4b46b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
