_:r6228548dacdb67faeed386cc_nb24f400ee46a4e9488c06fa46bd31c5db6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Turnkey research software platform for all aspects of the neuroscientific research process. Provides a comprehensive suite of readily usable and fully integrated software with robust testing and deployment infrastructure." .
