_:rb834464da77613ea571d66df_n62ebe3a7896a43e7b4635f6cb1eef460b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "A reproducible and generalizable software workflow for analysis of large-scale neuroimaging data collections using BIDS Apps" .
_:rb834464da77613ea571d66df_n62ebe3a7896a43e7b4635f6cb1eef460b11 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> .
