_:rf22bac21705da27627d3081f_n116c0be5fa164d0180f624ff66bd71a9b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> .
